        </li>
        <li>
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M8 12l3 3 5-5" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          <span>V-Kool's spectrally selective construction minimizes <a href="/benefits/energy-savings/" class="vk-body-link">Wi-Fi and cellular interference</a> on dense commercial floors — a key advantage for Philadelphia's tech-heavy Center City tenants</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M8 12l3 3 5-5" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          <span>All VK series films block 99% UV — protecting interiors, furnishings, and artwork on Philadelphia's south- and west-facing facades where fade damage is irreversible</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M8 12l3 3 5-5" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          <span>Independent research shows applied solar control films can reduce commercial <a href="/benefits/uv-protection/" class="vk-body-link">heating and cooling energy use</a> — V-Kool commercial customers typically report 10–25% annual energy cost reduction with 2–4 year payback</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
      <div class="vk-why__climate-facts">
        <div class="vk-why__climate-item"><span class="vk-why__climate-num">94%</span><span class="vk-why__climate-label">IR rejection (VK70)</span></div>
        <div class="vk-why__climate-item"><span class="vk-why__climate-num">~9%</span><span class="vk-why__climate-label">Exterior reflectance (VK70)</span></div>
